Our FY2026 guidance for consolidated revenue is $19.4–$20.2 billion, reflecting anticipated growth across Cloud, Subscriptions, and Industrial Solutions. Guidance assumptions include continued subscription renewals, mid-single-digit organic growth in Industrial Solutions, stable foreign-exchange rates versus Q4 FY2025, and gross-to-operating leverage from cost programs. Key assumptions for investors and analysts are summarized below:
- subscription retention above 90%;
- Industrial Solutions organic growth ~4–6%;
- capital expenditures of approx. $650 million.
